--- 2026-09-05, timing decision
The CPAN upload and the CPANSec mail go out together, so the fix is
installable the moment the hole becomes public. The mail tells CPANSec that
2026-09-18 works as planned, and that publishing sooner is fine too, because
no protective window remains. IMPORTANT for the ordering: the mail claims
"goes to CPAN at the same moment as this mail", so the upload has to be
through before it is sent, or the sentence is untrue.
